    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      279.29,
      401.9,
      301.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      312.29,
      401.89,
      334.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Apartment Ownership(Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.29,
      401.9,
      378.59
    ],
    "text": "2.The provisions of this Act shall be in operation for aperiod of five years from the date of commencement of thisAct.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      389.33,
      401.87,
      422.63
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The Registrar shall register under section 6 of theApartment Ownership Law, No 11 of 1973, the plans of allsuch Condominium Properties as are owned by-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      433.25,
      363.59,
      444.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)the Commissioner for National Housing;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      455.33,
      389.14,
      466.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)the National Housing Development Authority;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.89,
      477.29,
      341.16,
      488.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)the Urban Development Authority;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      499.25,
      401.87,
      521.63
    ],
    "text": "(d)the Sri Lanka Land Reclamation and DevelopmentCorporation; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.89,
      532.25,
      401.88,
      576.59
    ],
    "text": "(e)the State or any other agency by which aCondominium Property has been constructed onState owned land under the Tsunami ResettlementProgramme of the Government,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      587.33,
      401.9,
      631.67
    ],
    "text": "and which were constructed prior to December 31, 2009 andthe possession of which has been handed over to any personor persons by way of sale, lease, rent or rent purchase,notwithstanding-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      180.33,
      642.29,
      401.86,
      668.03
    ],
    "text": "(i)the non-availability of the building plans approvedby the local authority;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      314.59,
      446.13,
      323.66
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
