      202.97,
      401.88,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "specified in pragraphs (a) to (e) (both inclusive) of subsection(1), as the case may be, and was constructed prior to December31, 2009, and that the possession of such Property has beenhanded over to any person by way of sale, lease, rent or rentpurchase shall be prima facie proof of the facts containedtherein.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
