    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      286.97,
      392.14,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "4.In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      310.97,
      401.87,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cCommissioner for National Housing\u201d means theCommissioner of National Housingappointed under the National Housing Act(Chapter 401);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      370.97,
      401.89,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cCondominium Management Authority\u201d or\u201cAuthority\u201d means the CondominiumManagement Authority established under theCondominium Management Authority Law,No. 10 of 1973;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      442.97,
      401.88,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cCondominium Property\u201d means the CondominiumProperty within the meaning of the ApartmentOwnership Law, No. 11 of 1973;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      490.97,
      401.87,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cMinister\u201d means the Minister assigned the subject ofHousing under Article 43 of the Constitution;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      526.97,
      401.87,
      586.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cNational Housing Development Authority\u201d meansthe National Housing DevelopmentAuthority established under the NationalHousing Development Authority Act, No. 17of 1979;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      598.97,
      401.89,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "\u201cRegistrar\u201d means the Registrar of Lands appointedunder the Registration of DocumentsOrdinance (Chapter 117) having jurisdictionover the registration district in which theCondominium Property to be registered issituated;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
